          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Gibbs has loved trains for as long as he can remember so he’s leading this mission to find out more about rail travel and how it all began. They’ll begin with horse and carts and investigate the wooden tracks they travelled along (trying not to be trod on by a horse) before moving through time to see steam trains, railroads, the subway, right through to the high speed trains of today. They’ll even explore trains in space - well, kind of! ",
